== A1: S-9 — unfenced F reads fenced T (LWW); out = set of T values F saw (a JOIN, converted)
  BSP   (replay oracle) T,out:  (w1 (w1 w2))
  DRAIN (production)    T,out:  (w1 (w1 w2))
  K1    (DIRECT, no fence) T,out:  (w2 (w2))
  K>1F  (fence alternation) T,out:  (w2 (w2))
  converted cell `out`: K>1F vs BSP DIFFER; K>1F vs K1 same
  fence counters: ((alternations . 1) (direct-fires . 5) (direct-quiescence-detections . 2) (fenced-fires . 2) (subrun-rounds . 1))
== A1b: S-9 with F installed between the writers (K = 1 sees both values of T)
  BSP   (replay oracle) T,out:  (late (early late))
  DRAIN (production)    T,out:  (early (early late))
  K1    (DIRECT, no fence) T,out:  (late (early late))
  K>1F  (fence alternation) T,out:  (late (late))
